iption":"Attain 100% of Ritual Relics enhanced.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1351630/981356656279ba9d975171fa2628cff753ee3326.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":39.29999923706055,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_1_25","strName":"Untouchable","strDescription":"Use Flash Move 100 times.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1351630/3c33206d673f30f33d9d4a5347414af981692ba6.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":39,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_1_12","strName":"Intrepid Tourist","strDescription":"Attain 100% of landmarks discovered.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1351630/fe26751a50ff36ba52bdadf28b533a17d4593f10.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":38.70000076293945,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0}],"vecAchievedHidden":[{"strID":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_2_11","strName":"To Freedom","strDescription":"Begin your escape from the prison.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1351630/612f687dd28f8e5bfe9b52cc911d62407364441b.jpg","bAchieved":true,"rtUnlocked":1759740070,"flAchieved":0},{"strID":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_2_12","strName":"Adol, the Fugitive","strDescription":"Clear the prologue.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1351630/f39a0cea1194c5a94e11891d52d90ad64d3c32e6.jpg","bAchieved":true,"rtUnlocked":1759742313,"flAchieved":0},{"strID":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_2_13","strName":"Monstrum Nox","strDescription":"Clear Chapter 1.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1351630/e7ed2e627f3aaa5c6028b24b7be5ad5f91d46fc4.jpg","bAchieved":true,"rtUnlocked":1759751717,"flAchieved":0},{"strID":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_2_14","strName":"The White Cat's Melancholy","strDescription":"Clear Chapter 2.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1351630/cb45b3c36c95d45f8ca24bb18756b25739112203.jpg","bAchieved":true,"rtUnlocked":1759988679,"flAchieved":0},{"strID":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_2_15","strName":"The Feral Hawk's Fury","strDescription":"Clear Chapter 3.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1351630/c4ee4b8f3c3d16fe0b4a59558f1c4f5b2f7b1299.jpg","bAchieved":true,"rtUnlocked":1760088574,"flAchieved":0}],"nTotal":54,"nAchieved":7}}],["achievementmap",{"version":5,"data":"[]"}],["usernews",{"version":5,"data":[]}],["gameactivity",{"version":5,"data":[]}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"Nihon Falcom","strURL":null},{"strName":"PH3 GmbH","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/developer/PH3"},{"strName":"Engine Software BV","strURL":null}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"NIS America, Inc.","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/nisa"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"Ys","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/franchise/Ys"}]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"[b]Feared Protectors:[/b] Play as any of the six notorious Monstrum, each with their own unique Gifts that grant abilities such as scaling sheer walls or detecting hidden objects to protect the city from shadowy creatures. \r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351630/extras/4319d5402a83d3e758815768209cc4e4.poster.avif?t=1732665686\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351630/extras/4319d5402a83d3e758815768209cc4e4.webm?t=1732665686\" width=\"616\" height=\"348\"][/imgvid]\r\n\r\n[b]The World Within the Walls:[/b] Explore the massive city, accept quests to aid the townsfolk, and enter the Grimwald Nox to vanquish the threats to Balduq.\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351630/extras/6c5e232330a6c0d645d18074aefc5979.poster.avif?t=1732665686\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351630/extras/6c5e232330a6c0d645d18074aefc5979.webm?t=1732665686\" width=\"616\" height=\"348\"][/imgvid]\r\n\r\n[b]Strength of the Night:[/b] Familiar mechanics such as Flash Dodge and Flash Guard allow you to outmaneuver your foes, while new additions such as Gifts and Boost Mode further augment your ability to fight.\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351630/extras/4f2c9eec5ec9ea3d731f32c41084a65b.poster.avif?t=1732665686\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351630/extras/4f2c9eec5ec9ea3d731f32c41084a65b.webm?t=1732665686\" width=\"616\" height=\"348\"][/imgvid]\r\n\r\n[h2]Story[/h2]\r\n&quot;What is real is defined by what is not.\r\nWho one is defined by who one isn't.&quot;\r\nTo move forward, one must accept these truths.\r\n&quot;Yes, in this prison—this cradle—\r\nmy dreams and reality became one.&quot;\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351630/extras/6568a840f46de33840a9867ee05cbdf7.poster.avif?t=1732665686\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351630/extras/6568a840f46de33840a9867ee05cbdf7.webm?t=1732665686\" width=\"616\" height=\"348\"][/imgvid]\r\n\r\nRenowned adventurer Adol “the Red” Christin and his companion Dogi arrive at Balduq, a city annexed by the Romun Empire, only for Adol to be detained before setting foot inside. While imprisoned, he meets a mysterious woman named Aprilis who turns him into a Monstrum, a being with supernatural Gifts and the power to exorcise monsters. Now, Adol must ally with his fellow Monstrum to fend off the fearsome threats emerging from a shadowy dimension called the Grimwald Nox, as well as unravel the mysteries of the Monstrum curse, and the truth behind the unrest within Balduq.","strSnippet":"While imprisoned in Balduq, Adol is cursed and becomes a Monstrum. With his newfound powers, he must stop the Grimwald Nox from consuming the city."}}],["badge",{"version":1,"data":{"dtNextRetry":null,"strName":"","strIconURL":"https://cdn.fastly.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/items/1351630/","nLevel":0,"nMaxLevel":5,"nXP":0,"bMaxed":null,"strNextLevelName":"The White Cat","nNextLevelXP":100,"rgCards":[{"strName":"The Crimson King","strTitle":"The Crimson King","strImgURL":"https://community.fastly.steamstatic.com/economy/image/IzMF03bk9WpSBq-S-ekoE33L-iLqGFHVaU25ZzQNQcXdA3g5gMEPvUZZEfSMJ6dESN8p_2SVTY7V2NgMwXIKmz4QPivs0XEwUe1pc-jUyQjoruzGN335b3HNIiDeGQM7GbZZNWneq2alsbzCEDrIQektQw9RdfZQ-jBNNc-PbRpr1tEPr2bu2VRzGVAqfddCdR2Ew3kSNrh4n3BAc55XzHXxIpze1AwwaxI_WOqyUu7GO9ekk3wlXEhnHKMbYoiRsDuspsDnLPqENAefUTA","strArtworkURL":"https://cdn.fastly.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/items/1351630/62644abe1a19a347e0ec04bc2d12396d8c0174b8.jpg","strMarketHash":"1351630-The Crimson King (Trading Card)","nOwned":0},{"strName":"The Doll","strTitle":"The Doll","strImgURL":"https://community.fastly.steamstatic.com/economy/image/IzMF03bk9WpSBq-S-ekoE33L-iLqGFHVaU25ZzQNQcXdA3g5gMEPvUZZEfSMJ6dESN8p_2SVTY7V2NgMwXIKmz4QPivs0XEwUe1pc-_JzAm9qO-MG3GqPzKQfySPSFpuSuENZm-K-jWi7ejCRzicRbt4SgsGLKFRoGRJNcyIawx9itAdqWqqk0FvIR8lc8JDLVjqmCJGZLgkmXVKcsoByyekc5aL0FswbBI8W7u0V72Qb4KmkSknWRJ5X_5Ncs2YukQIf5jT","strArtworkURL":"https://cdn.fastly.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/items/1351630/f4da371a7b2d2d2ba1b44c52ac9e735b135eb1be.jpg","strMarketHash":"1351630-The Doll","nOwned":0},{"strName":"The Hawk","strTitle":"The Hawk","strImgURL":"https://community.fastly.steamstatic.com/economy/image/IzMF03bk9WpSBq-S-ekoE33L-iLqGFHVaU25ZzQNQcXdA3g5gMEPvUZZEfSMJ6dESN8p_2SVTY7V2NgMwXIKmz4QPivs0XEwUe1pc-PH1w69qO-MG3GqbTbBfXGMT106H7FdMzvY_DGl4bjBQWuaEOp9EABXfPRQ9GFPbsqBbQx9itAdqWqqk0FvIR8lc8JDLVjqmCJGZLgkmXVKcsoByyekc5aL0FswbBI8W7u0V72Qb4KmkSknWRJ5X_5Ncs2Yuq3xOBVQ","strArtworkURL":"https://cdn.fastly.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/items/